# Public service overrides for local, staging, or preview builds.
# Leave unset to use the production URLs in src/config/services.json, so `bun dev`
# signs in and talks to athas.dev without running the website locally.
# Point at a local `www` checkout (`bun dev` in www) only when working on the API:
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:3000
# VITE_WEBSITE_URL=https://staging.athas.dev
# VITE_EXTENSIONS_CDN_BASE_URL=https://staging.athas.dev/extensions
# VITE_SKILLS_REGISTRY_URL=https://staging.athas.dev/skills/index.json
# VITE_UPDATE_BASE_URL=https://staging.athas.dev
